WEBVTT

00:01:28.918 --> 00:01:32.130
I often generate moves
that are based on the human experience.

00:01:32.547 --> 00:01:35.424
I take these moves,
I string them together,

00:01:35.424 --> 00:01:37.343
twist and play with their pace,

00:01:37.385 --> 00:01:39.595
in order to create more meaningful work.

00:01:40.346 --> 00:01:42.056
Let me show you what I mean.

00:01:42.098 --> 00:01:44.058
Here's a music video, "Chandelier,"

00:01:44.058 --> 00:01:45.726
that I choreographed for Sia,

00:01:45.768 --> 00:01:48.563
featuring the incredible dancer
Maddie Ziegler.

00:01:48.604 --> 00:01:49.730
("Chandelier" by Sia)

00:01:49.772 --> 00:01:53.067
(Lyrics) Won’t open my eyes
Keep my glass full until morning light

00:01:53.109 --> 00:01:55.862
Because I'm just holding on for tonight

00:01:55.903 --> 00:01:58.614
Help me, I'm holding on for dear life

00:01:58.614 --> 00:02:01.367
Won't look down, won't open my eyes